  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Right now. the current implementation of a user's location in their QM profile amongst all the other text makes it feel too cluttered and easy to skim over. It's also not immediately obvious that you can click the world name there to bring up the user's instance location in the main menu. I included a poorly made mockup of where I think addition information about where a user is located could fit in in the QM. This information could be similar to what is displayed in the Here tab. If a user is in a private world, could be a slimmer box indicating as such.",
